1
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:07,500
你聽到了嗎 我找不到手機了
Do you hear that? I can't find my phone.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,000
聽起來像是從水果碗里傳出來的
I think it's coming from the fruit bowl.

3
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:15,600
不要啊
Oh, no.

4
00:00:18,815 --> 00:00:21,065
我又開始夢游變魔術了
I've been doing sleep magic again.

5
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:23,260
你看起來像完全沒睡過覺
You look like you haven't slept at all.

6
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,760
可能一晚就只睡了一兩小時吧
Maybe an hour or two a night.

7
00:00:24,775 --> 00:00:25,965
我什么都試過了
I've tried everything:

8
00:00:26,464 --> 00:00:28,594
睡前的熱水澡 冥想
warm shower before bed, meditation,

9
00:00:28,594 --> 00:00:31,114
閱讀我手機操作系統的用戶協議
reading my operating system's user agreement.

10
00:00:31,114 --> 00:00:33,234
你有沒有試過問艾麗克斯
Did you try asking Alex about the struggles that are unique

11
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:34,420
女性在科學領域所特有的掙扎
to women in science?

12
00:00:34,420 --> 00:00:36,460
昨晚深夜時候問的 她好像還沒講完
Late last night. I think she's still going.

13
00:00:36,824 --> 00:00:38,294
這失眠時機太糟糕了
It's the worst possible timing.

14
00:00:38,474 --> 00:00:40,284
我今天要為一個重要的待售屋拍廣告
I have a video shoot for a big listing today,

15
00:00:40,284 --> 00:00:41,464
而且我也得上鏡
and I'm supposed to be on camera.

16
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:43,060
我得走了
I gotta go.

17
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:45,440
爸爸 你的鑰匙
Dad, your keys.

18
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:48,940
我來開車吧
You know what? I'll drive.

19
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:51,540
祝你面試順利
Good luck with your interview.

20
00:00:51,693 --> 00:00:54,273
你猜怎么著 我決定不去了
Oh, you know what? I decided to pass on that.

21
00:00:55,173 --> 00:00:55,843
為什么
Why?

22
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,380
那是個很棒的工作 你之前表現得很期待啊
That's an amazing job, and you were so excited.

23
00:00:58,380 --> 00:01:00,880
我想那只是我感到受寵若驚吧
I think I was flattered.

24
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:03,140
就像你去酒吧 有人送來一杯酒那樣
Like when you go to a bar and a guy sends you a drink.

25
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:05,780
我不懂好嗎 我在國內頂尖的科技大學讀書
I'm at the leading scientific university in the country.

26
00:01:05,780 --> 00:01:07,780
里面的宅男連他們機器人的眼睛都不敢直視
Those guys can't even look their robots in the eye.

27
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:11,540
我被邀請去"內德叔叔餅干"面試首席執行官職位
I was asked to interview for CEO of Uncle Ned's Cookies,

28
00:01:11,540 --> 00:01:13,860
那公司是休閑食品行業的重量級選手
a major player in the snack food industry.

29
00:01:14,082 --> 00:01:15,692
這個職位空缺原來是因為
The position opened up because it turns out

30
00:01:15,692 --> 00:01:17,872
內德叔叔喜歡在工作時玩弄...
Uncle Ned liked to play fast and loose with...

31
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:20,040
他的生殖器
his genitals at work.

32
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:22,480
媽媽 你需要參加這場面試
Mom, you need to take that interview.

33
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,720
現在人們正在把雄性渣滓
Now that they're purging male creeps

34
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:25,940
清除出行政職位
from executive positions,

35
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:29,100
強大的女性終得在談判桌上占有一席之地
strong women are finally getting their seat at the table.

36
00:01:29,100 --> 00:01:31,100
親愛的 我已經有一席之地了
Honey, I already have a seat at the table.

37
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:32,980
實際上 我在談判桌的主位呢
In fact, at the head of the table.

38
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:34,340
你是說當外公不在時嗎
You mean when Grandpa's not there?

39
00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:35,360
談判桌有兩個主位
Tables have two heads.

40
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:38,080
我只是說出了我標志性的殘酷事實
I'm only bringing out my trademark hard truths

41
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:39,440
因為我不想讓你放棄
because I don't want you to pass up

42
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:42,460
在父權制順從社會中出頭的絕佳機會
an amazing opportunity in deference to the patriarchy.

43
00:01:42,491 --> 00:01:45,350
寶貝 我現在的工作里有許多絕佳機會
Honey, I have a lot of amazing opportunities at my current job.

44
00:01:45,350 --> 00:01:47,840
而且"內德叔叔"不都是抽大麻的人在吃的嗎
And isn't Uncle Ned's basically just stoner food?

45
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,990
我們愛"內德叔叔"
We love Uncle Ned's!

46
00:01:48,990 --> 00:01:50,431
我好想念它們
I miss those.

47
00:01:52,210 --> 00:01:54,160
謝謝你的關心 不過我會沒事的
Thank you for your concern, but I'll be fine.

48
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:56,540
也許我只是在發泄我自己
Maybe I'm just projecting my own frustrations

49
00:01:56,540 --> 00:01:57,760
在科學界的挫折感
with the science world.

50
00:01:57,960 --> 00:02:00,700
你知道嗎 那里只有三名女博士
You know, there are only three female PhDs --

51
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:03,649
甜心 很抱歉 我得保持清醒不能犯困
Sweetheart, I'm sorry, but I have to stay alert.

52
00:02:18,079 --> 00:02:20,469
莉莉寶貝 開門 上學要遲到了
Lily, sweetie, open up. We're gonna be late for school.

53
00:02:20,469 --> 00:02:22,538
我不去上學 別管我
I'm not going! Leave me alone!

54
00:02:22,538 --> 00:02:24,618
-另一個危機 -她把自己鎖浴室里了
- Another meltdown. - She's locked herself in the bathroom.

55
00:02:24,618 --> 00:02:26,538
現在你后悔當初沒讓我在后院建茅房了吧
Now don't you wish you'd let me build that outhouse?

56
00:02:27,020 --> 00:02:27,660
不后悔
Still no.

57
00:02:28,688 --> 00:02:30,278
她 她怎么了
W-What is going on with her?

58
00:02:30,458 --> 00:02:32,148
她最近變得好情緒化
S-She's been so moody recently,

59
00:02:32,220 --> 00:02:34,240
前一分鐘還在尖叫 下一分鐘就哭了
screaming one minute, crying the next.

60
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:37,260
我想我知道這是什么情況了
You know what? I think I know what this might be.

61
00:02:37,848 --> 00:02:41,177
她要在今天的科學課上交一座火山模型
She had a volcano due in science class today,

62
00:02:41,177 --> 00:02:42,727
我在她這年紀時 肩負重任的話
and when I was her age and had a big project,

63
00:02:42,727 --> 00:02:44,417
我會焦慮不安 表現得和這一樣
I'd get stressed out and act just like this.

64
00:02:44,420 --> 00:02:46,100
你知道嗎 我到現在都還在做
You know, I still have nightmares about

65
00:02:46,100 --> 00:02:47,600
當年北方侵略戰爭模型的噩夢
my War of Northern Aggression diorama.

66
00:02:47,647 --> 00:02:49,137
好了 我們結婚時說了什么
Okay. What did we say when we got married?

67
00:02:49,137 --> 00:02:50,207
永遠不帶著怒氣上床
Never go to bed angry

68
00:02:50,207 --> 00:02:51,587
以及叫它內戰 而不是北方侵略你們南方
and you have to call it the Civil War.

69
00:02:51,587 --> 00:02:53,377
好了 我去看看她作業做到什么程度了
Okay, I'll go check and see how far she's gotten.

70
00:02:53,540 --> 00:02:56,080
好 莉莉寶貝 出來吧 好嗎
Okay, Lily, honey, come on. Come out, all right?

71
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:58,080
我們能幫你修好你的火山
We can help you fix your volcano,

72
00:02:58,167 --> 00:03:00,066
你還是能來得及上學的
and -- and you'll still make it to school.

73
00:03:00,066 --> 00:03:00,906
最壞的結果不過就是
Worst comes to worst,

74
00:03:01,220 --> 00:03:02,880
第一節課[初潮]稍稍遲到一點
you'll be a little late for your first period.

75
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:04,660
其實 她可能"早到"了
Actually, she's a little early.

76
00:03:05,616 --> 00:03:06,326
所以...
So --

77
00:03:06,326 --> 00:03:07,726
莉莉現在是個月經者了
Lily is a menstruator now.

78
00:03:07,726 --> 00:03:08,656
不是那樣叫的
That's not what you call it.

79
00:03:08,656 --> 00:03:10,076
我只是有點羞于承認
Well, I'm just ashamed to admit

80
00:03:10,076 --> 00:03:11,626
我們從未幫她準備過這個
that we never really prepared her for it.

81
00:03:11,626 --> 00:03:13,756
我們曾經試過一次
Hey, we tried that one time.

82
00:03:15,906 --> 00:03:17,586
姑娘 你好啊
Hey, girl. Hey!

83
00:03:17,586 --> 00:03:19,965
寶貝 小爸和我在想
So, sweetie, Daddy and I were wondering if,

84
00:03:19,965 --> 00:03:21,955
既然你開始穿少女文胸了
now that you're wearing a training bra,

85
00:03:21,955 --> 00:03:25,395
如果你對自己正在改變的身體還有其他疑問
if you had any other questions about your changing body.

86
00:03:25,395 --> 00:03:25,975
我們能不說這個嗎
Can we just not?

87
00:03:25,975 --> 00:03:27,556
-聽起來不錯 -好極了
- Sounds good. - Yeah, perfect.

88
00:03:27,905 --> 00:03:29,325
我以為你會請克萊爾
I thought you were gonna ask Claire

89
00:03:29,430 --> 00:03:30,730
跟莉莉說說這個
to talk to Lily about this.

90
00:03:30,730 --> 00:03:33,210
我有嘗試 但當時克萊爾心情很不好
Well, I was, but when I tried, Claire was in such a mood,

91
00:03:33,210 --> 00:03:34,070
因為諷刺的是[更年期]...
because, ironically...

92
00:03:34,295 --> 00:03:37,474
我們不能搞砸 不能讓她有心理陰影
Okay, we can't screw this up. We cannot give her a complex.

93
00:03:37,474 --> 00:03:39,624
你看看能不能聯系到克萊爾
Okay, you see if you can track down Claire.

94
00:03:39,710 --> 00:03:41,350
我會去藥房
I will go to the pharmacy

95
00:03:41,350 --> 00:03:44,130
試著克服我對女性護理用品通道的恐懼
and try and conquer my fear of the feminine care aisle.

96
00:03:45,010 --> 00:03:45,690
可憐的莉莉
Poor Lily.

97
00:03:45,694 --> 00:03:46,764
還可能更糟
You know, it could be worse.

98
00:03:46,764 --> 00:03:49,424
如果她是羊 每十七天都要這樣一次
If she were a sheep, she'd be dealing with this every 17 days.

99
00:03:49,424 --> 00:03:51,344
答應我 我不在時你不會這樣說
Promise you won't say that while I'm gone.

100
00:03:53,274 --> 00:03:55,154
好了 我們再來試試包襁褓
All right, let's try the swaddle again.

101
00:03:55,224 --> 00:03:57,133
把毛毯折成三角狀
Our blankets are folded into triangles,

102
00:03:57,133 --> 00:03:58,643
左邊折一下
we do a left tuck,

103
00:03:58,643 --> 00:03:59,734
下面折一下
a toe tuck,

104
00:03:59,873 --> 00:04:01,083
右邊折一下
a right tuck,

105
00:04:01,083 --> 00:04:03,463
然后大功告成 嬰兒卷餅就好啦
and voila, baby burrito.

106
00:04:03,463 --> 00:04:05,230
你是怎么包成功的
Ugh! How did you do yours?!

107
00:04:05,230 --> 00:04:07,363
那個暑假在地下室卷餅小作坊工作
I guess that summer working at Burrito Basement

108
00:04:07,550 --> 00:04:08,730
感染大腸桿菌 現在終于值得了
was worth the E. Coli.

109
00:04:08,753 --> 00:04:11,453
迪蘭和我正在上嬰兒護理課程
Dylan and I have been taking a baby care class.

110
00:04:11,470 --> 00:04:13,830
很令人沮喪 因為即使他缺了一些課
It's frustrating, because even though he's missed some,

111
00:04:13,830 --> 00:04:14,830
成績也能大殺四方
he's crushing it.

112
00:04:14,830 --> 00:04:16,570
是說課程啦 不是練習用的寶寶
The class, not the practice doll.

113
00:04:16,910 --> 00:04:18,770
殺寶寶的人是我
That was me.

114
00:04:19,152 --> 00:04:21,432
繼續吧 我們今天還要練習什么
Let's move on.What else do we have to get down for today?

115
00:04:21,432 --> 00:04:22,993
-拍嗝 -太好了
- Burping. - Great!

116
00:04:23,172 --> 00:04:25,942
我拍拍拍 嗝 還有什么
A bur-bur-burp. Boom. What's next?

117
00:04:25,962 --> 00:04:26,892
等等 媽媽
Hold on, Mom.

118
00:04:26,892 --> 00:04:28,232
你還記得萬一過肩拍不管用時
Do you remember the four other methods

119
00:04:28,370 --> 00:04:30,190
其他的四種方法嗎
in case over-the-shoulder doesn't work?

120
00:04:30,662 --> 00:04:32,322
其中一招是找人把他嚇出嗝嗎
Uh, was one scare 'em?

121
00:04:32,430 --> 00:04:33,850
還有放在大腿上拍
There's over-the-lap,

122
00:04:33,850 --> 00:04:34,890
膝上拍
over-the-knee,

123
00:04:34,890 --> 00:04:37,050
奶奶式拍 和蹦蹦拍
Grandmother's burp, and the bounce burp.

124
00:04:37,371 --> 00:04:39,191
為什么我學這么慢啊
Ugh. Why do I suck at this?

125
00:04:39,241 --> 00:04:41,541
我理解這內容很多 不過你會慢慢學會的
I know it's overwhelming, but you're gonna get there.

126
00:04:41,630 --> 00:04:43,170
別擔心
Don't worry.

127
00:04:44,790 --> 00:04:46,730
別炫耀了
Stop showing off.

128
00:04:46,730 --> 00:04:49,450
太好了 你在這坐著呢
Oh, good. You're sitting down.

129
00:04:49,450 --> 00:04:50,190
我們有個問題
We have a problem.

130
00:04:50,331 --> 00:04:53,171
我上公司官網 發現有人
I went on the company website, and somebody left off

131
00:04:53,171 --> 00:04:55,510
取消了總裁級柜的磨砂銅升級
the brushed brass upgrade on the Executive Premiere.

132
00:04:55,510 --> 00:04:57,410
是的是的 我停止磨砂銅升級了
Oh, yeah. Yeah, I eighty-sixed that.

133
00:04:57,490 --> 00:04:58,610
可是我已經簽署同意了
I already signed off on it.

134
00:04:58,610 --> 00:05:00,390
可能他們后來又想來跟我確認一下
They probably just wanted to double-check with me.

135
00:05:00,390 --> 00:05:02,650
你也知道 我確實有三十年的經驗
You know, I do have 30 years' experience.

136
00:05:02,670 --> 00:05:04,700
《櫥柜時代周刊》曾經稱我為
Closet Time Magazine once called me

137
00:05:04,990 --> 00:05:08,250
"存儲空間[太空]競賽中的尼爾·阿姆斯特朗"
"The Neil Armstrong of the storage space race."

138
00:05:08,250 --> 00:05:10,110
得了吧 爸 你一周就工作兩天
Okay, Dad, you work two days a week,

139
00:05:10,110 --> 00:05:12,430
上次員工會議還全程涂鴉
and you spent the entire last staff meeting

140
00:05:12,430 --> 00:05:13,390
畫菠蘿
doodling a pineapple.

141
00:05:13,409 --> 00:05:15,599
這么著吧 你掌管伯克郡生產線
How about this -- take the helm on the Berkshire line.

142
00:05:15,599 --> 00:05:16,729
我中斷那個項目了
I discontinued that.

143
00:05:16,729 --> 00:05:18,809
是這樣沒錯 不過后來杰夫在洗手間逼我
Yeah, but then Jeff cornered me in the men's room,

144
00:05:18,809 --> 00:05:19,989
我又重啟了
and I relaunched it.

145
00:05:19,989 --> 00:05:25,409
好吧 爸 你這樣讓我十分難做
Okay, Dad, you are putting me in an impossible position.

146
00:05:25,409 --> 00:05:28,389
我做完決定 一個轉身你就推翻我的決定
I make decisions, and then you go around undermining them.

147
00:05:28,389 --> 00:05:30,689
這里的大家都很重視你的看法 克萊爾
Everybody values your opinions around here, Claire.

148
00:05:30,689 --> 00:05:32,668
事實上 我現在就需要你的看法
In fact, I'd like your opinion right now.

149
00:05:32,750 --> 00:05:35,310
這個看著像個冰屋嗎
Does this look like an igloo?

150
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:38,290
內德叔叔餅干公司想讓我去當首席執行官
Uncle Ned's Cookies wants me to be their CEO.

151
00:05:38,318 --> 00:05:40,438
什么 你在考慮去內德叔叔公司
What?! You're considering Uncle Ned's?!

152
00:05:40,438 --> 00:05:41,471
你嗑藥嗑高了嗎
Are you on reefer?!

153
00:05:41,471 --> 00:05:43,748
那家公司有巨大的增長潛力
That company has tremendous growth potential.

154
00:05:43,748 --> 00:05:45,908
那只是零食 這可是衣柜
It's snacks! This is closets!

155
00:05:45,908 --> 00:05:47,678
你現在已經在大舞臺上了
You're already at the show!

156
00:05:47,678 --> 00:05:49,508
至少在那里 我能做老板
At least there, I can be the boss

157
00:05:49,508 --> 00:05:51,907
而不只是老板的女兒
and not just the boss's daughter.

158
00:05:51,930 --> 00:05:53,710
所以現在是到了我跟你道歉
Is this the part where I apologize

159
00:05:53,710 --> 00:05:55,050
抱歉把曾經被《高級衣柜雜志》
for handing you a company

160
00:05:55,050 --> 00:05:57,170
稱為"頂層"的公司交給你的環節嗎
Closet Fancy once called "Top shelf"?!

161
00:05:57,170 --> 00:06:00,010
不 是到了我要去參加面試
No, this is the part where I take an interview

162
00:06:00,010 --> 00:06:03,130
跟那些能真正認同我價值的人共事的環節
with people who actually recognize my value!

163
00:06:03,130 --> 00:06:06,910
靜音滑動門都摔不出氣勢
