I'm sorry. I got this.

335
00:12:40,250 --> 00:12:42,750
想象一下從這個視角看到的生活
Imagine life from this perspective.

336
00:12:42,750 --> 00:12:44,310
那玩意要撞上我了
That thing is gonna hit me!

337
00:12:44,310 --> 00:12:46,990
最棒的是 整棟房子都是自動化的
And best of all, the entire house is fully automated.

338
00:12:46,990 --> 00:12:51,170
你用手機就能啟動美麗的噴泉
You can turn on the gorgeous fountains right from your phone.

339
00:12:51,170 --> 00:12:53,470
靠 怎么不靈了
Shoot. They're not working.

340
00:12:53,470 --> 00:12:55,610
我又能感覺到那根腳趾了
Hey, I can feel my toe!

341
00:12:55,610 --> 00:12:59,130
這本則是關于能引起
And this one is about hormonal fluctuations

342
00:12:59,130 --> 00:13:01,450
激烈情緒波動的荷爾蒙波動
that can cause radical mood swings.

343
00:13:01,635 --> 00:13:04,295
前一秒 你還好好的 下一秒
One minute, you're totally fine, and then the next,

344
00:13:04,295 --> 00:13:06,055
-你就... -滾回家吧 死書呆
- you're just -- - Go home, nerd!

345
00:13:07,125 --> 00:13:09,155
...沖想幫你的人發火
...lashing out when someone is trying to help you.

346
00:13:09,155 --> 00:13:10,065
謝謝你幫忙
Okay, well, thank you for helping,

347
00:13:10,065 --> 00:13:10,894
你別放在心上
and don't take it personally.

348
00:13:10,894 --> 00:13:13,004
至少現在我們知道她為什么說我的招牌反折袖口
At least now we know why she called my signature cuffs

349
00:13:13,004 --> 00:13:15,234
比《雨中曲》女主角黛比·雷諾茲的博物館還俗氣
tackier than the Debbie Reynolds museum.

350
00:13:15,234 --> 00:13:17,194
對 絕對是因為荷爾蒙波動才攻擊你的袖口
Y-Yes, that was definitely the hormones talking.

351
00:13:17,370 --> 00:13:19,910
你們把這事看得太嚴重了
Look, everyone's taking this whole thing way too seriously.

352
00:13:19,964 --> 00:13:21,484
等我女兒的第一次"鯊魚嗜血周"到來時
When my daughter has her first Shark Week,

353
00:13:21,484 --> 00:13:22,974
我們只會一笑置之
we're just gonna laugh about it.

354
00:13:23,050 --> 00:13:24,130
女孩們就希望這樣
That's what girls want.

355
00:13:24,130 --> 00:13:25,550
畢竟下面
I mean, it is bananas

356
00:13:25,550 --> 00:13:26,930
每個月發生的場面都驚心動魄
what happens down there every month.

357
00:13:26,930 --> 00:13:28,770
唯一的好處是 月經提醒我該付賬單了
Only good thing is, it reminds me to pay my bills.

358
00:13:29,533 --> 00:13:31,703
難怪懷孕后 我的信用卡一直刷不了
Oh, that's why my credit card keeps getting denied.

359
00:13:31,703 --> 00:13:33,533
如果你有別的地方要去...
Hey, if there's somewhere you need to be --

360
00:13:33,533 --> 00:13:34,644
看老娘的
Just watch this.

361
00:13:37,593 --> 00:13:38,543
婊子
Hey, bitch.

362
00:13:38,543 --> 00:13:39,381
海莉也來了嗎
Haley's here?!

363
00:13:39,570 --> 00:13:41,170
沒錯 而且你高興點
That's right. And cheer up.

364
00:13:41,170 --> 00:13:43,610
你要錯過這件慘事帶來的唯一好處了
You're missing the whole silver lining in all of this.

365
00:13:43,610 --> 00:13:47,710
無論你做錯什么 月經都是你的免死金牌
A period is a Get Out Of Jail Free card for everything.

366
00:13:47,713 --> 00:13:48,902
考試前沒復習
Didn't study for a test?

367
00:13:48,902 --> 00:13:50,852
"人家經痛嘛"
"Oh, wah. I have cramps."

368
00:13:50,930 --> 00:13:52,250
不想上體育課
Don't want to go to gym class?

369
00:13:52,510 --> 00:13:53,830
"抱歉 來例假啦"
"Sorry -- lady problems."

370
00:13:53,942 --> 00:13:56,392
想吃掉整個大蛋糕 中途叫停不愉快的約會
Wanna eat a whole sheet cake? Shut down a bad date?

371
00:13:56,392 --> 00:13:58,482
把大麻裝進棉條盒子里 偷帶進演唱會
Smuggle some weed into a concert in your tampon box?

372
00:13:58,482 --> 00:13:59,692
不會有人檢查棉條盒的
Ain't nobody looking in there.

373
00:13:59,750 --> 00:14:01,110
你有什么毛病啊
What is wrong with you?!

374
00:14:01,110 --> 00:14:03,210
你就想給你女兒這種建議嗎
That's the advice you want to give your daughter?!

375
00:14:03,210 --> 00:14:05,110
我知道 我真是糟透了
I know! I'm a disaster!

376
00:14:05,110 --> 00:14:07,970
我要怎么當人媽媽 我連襁褓都不會包
How am I going to be a mother? I can't even make a swaddle!

377
00:14:07,970 --> 00:14:10,450
我會養出兩個廢物 就像我一樣
I'm gonna raise a couple losers, just like me!

378
00:14:10,450 --> 00:14:12,810
不是你們的錯 可愛的小笨蛋們
It's not your fault, you sweet dummies!

379
00:14:12,901 --> 00:14:14,141
莉莉
Lily!

380
00:14:14,141 --> 00:14:15,911
老天 你也來了
Oh, my God. You too?

381
00:14:16,111 --> 00:14:18,451
我給你熬了哥倫比亞藥糊
I made you a Colombian poultice.

382
00:14:18,451 --> 00:14:20,741
就是那玩意發出臭味嗎 我聞到想吐
Is that what stinks? It's making me sick!

383
00:14:20,830 --> 00:14:22,430
我們會把藥糊涂滿你肚皮
We're gonna rub it all over your belly,

384
00:14:22,430 --> 00:14:23,710
然后你就會好受多了
and it's gonna make you feel better.

385
00:14:23,710 --> 00:14:26,890
這藥膏涂到吐司上再配個煎蛋 味道也不錯哦
It's also not terrible on toast with a fried egg.

386
00:14:27,030 --> 00:14:28,438
外面到底有多少人
How many people are out there?!

387
00:14:28,438 --> 00:14:30,630
就幾個來支持你的女性
Just a few supportive women.

388
00:14:30,630 --> 00:14:32,080
姐妹們好啊
Hello, sisters.

389
00:14:32,110 --> 00:14:33,760
我一定是發錯群聊了
I must've texted the wrong thread.

390
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:36,040
請讓我跟大地女神談談
Allow me to talk to the Earth Goddess.

391
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:40,060
莉莉 我是繼小叔曼尼啦
Lily? Step-Uncle Manny's here.

392
00:14:40,070 --> 00:14:41,090
珍惜這個
Cherish this.

393
00:14:41,090 --> 00:14:43,640
你被賦予了創造生命的能力
You've been given the ability to create life.

394
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:46,389
每一下痙攣 每一次偏頭痛都提醒你...
Each cramp, each migraine should remind you --

395
00:14:46,389 --> 00:14:48,369
你他媽給我滾遠點 曼尼
Get the out of here, Manny!

396
00:14:50,359 --> 00:14:51,499
保重 各位
Take care, everybody.

397
00:14:51,499 --> 00:14:52,280
好
Yeah.

398
00:14:52,630 --> 00:14:57,670
克萊爾 進來
Claire, get in here.

399
00:14:57,829 --> 00:14:59,489
面試進行得如何
How'd the interview go?

400
00:14:59,990 --> 00:15:00,550
順利極了
Amazing.

401
00:15:00,550 --> 00:15:03,510
首先 那地方彌漫著香味
First of all, that place smells delicious.

402
00:15:03,510 --> 00:15:05,710
他們當場就決定聘請我
They made me an offer on the spot.

403
00:15:05,710 --> 00:15:07,690
當首席執行官 有公費旅行
CEO, travel...

404
00:15:07,690 --> 00:15:09,950
跟國會議員們打交道
hobnobbing with Congressmen.

405
00:15:09,950 --> 00:15:11,230
我不意外
Well, I'm not surprised.

406
00:15:11,230 --> 00:15:13,130
你是名出色的候選人
You're a terrific candidate.

407
00:15:13,130 --> 00:15:15,730
我拒絕了
I turned them down.

408
00:15:15,730 --> 00:15:16,270
為什么
Why?

409
00:15:16,270 --> 00:15:18,870
首先 因為我對這里每個人還有你
Well, first of all, because I made a commitment

410
00:15:18,870 --> 00:15:20,370
做出過承諾
to everyone here and to you.

411
00:15:20,370 --> 00:15:23,630
而且 離開這里感覺不對
And it just... didn't feel right to leave.

412
00:15:23,630 --> 00:15:25,970
你這么說 讓我接下來要說的話略顯尷尬
That makes what I'm about to say awkward.

413
00:15:27,097 --> 00:15:28,037
我準備辭職
I'm quitting.

414
00:15:28,037 --> 00:15:30,317
怎么 你有那么氣我嗎
Oh, wha-- You're that mad at me?

415
00:15:30,450 --> 00:15:32,490
不 我聽了你說的
No, I listened to what you said,

416
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:34,790
除非我讓位 否則你永遠不會
and you're never truly gonna be in charge

417
00:15:34,790 --> 00:15:36,090
真正掌管公司
until I get out of your way.

418
00:15:36,237 --> 00:15:37,437
你不必為了我這么做啊
You didn't have to do that for me.

419
00:15:37,590 --> 00:15:38,870
我不只是為了你
I didn't do it just for you.

420
00:15:38,870 --> 00:15:41,050
每個優秀的衣柜家都知道何時該高高掛起
Every good closet man knows when to hang it up.

421
00:15:41,050 --> 00:15:43,610
我認為 我準備好迎接新挑戰了
And I -- I think I'm ready for a new challenge.

422
00:15:43,616 --> 00:15:45,516
爸爸 可別去搞玻璃貼膜啊
Oh, Dad, not window tinting.

423
00:15:45,516 --> 00:15:48,736
做那個可好賺了 不過不是 那不適合我
It's like printing money, but no, it's not for me.

424
00:15:48,736 --> 00:15:50,536
我興奮期待的是這個
Here's what I'm excited about.

425
00:15:50,616 --> 00:15:51,926
我給你看看
Let me show you. Mm.

426
00:15:54,126 --> 00:15:55,297
這是什么鬼
What am I looking at?

427
00:15:55,416 --> 00:15:56,367
未來
The future.

428
00:15:56,726 --> 00:15:58,236
趣味狗狗床
Fun dog beds.

429
00:15:58,726 --> 00:16:01,336
天啊 這就是你之前在鬼畫符的菠蘿
Oh, my God. This is the pineapple you were doodling.

430
00:16:01,336 --> 00:16:03,225
沒錯 是我親自設計的
Yes! I designed it myself!

431
00:16:03,345 --> 00:16:05,045
酷 酷
Cool. Cool.

432
00:16:05,045 --> 00:16:06,375
話說 藥房會跟進
So, the pharmacy tracks

433
00:16:06,375 --> 00:16:08,035
你吃的藥如何相互影響的 對吧
how all of your medications interact, right?

434
00:16:08,035 --> 00:16:09,645
克萊爾 每年
Claire, every year,

435
00:16:09,645 --> 00:16:13,655
全美人民會花七百億美元在寵物身上
people in this country spend $70 billion on their pets.

436
00:16:13,655 --> 00:16:14,955
全美人民還是就你一人
People or just you?

437
00:16:14,955 --> 00:16:16,425
我已經找好制造商了
I got a manufacturer lined up.

438
00:16:16,425 --> 00:16:18,345
我會在網上賣 節省總開銷
I'll sell them online, keep the overhead low,

439
00:16:18,345 --> 00:16:20,455
去參加一些狗狗大會 超好玩的
go to a bunch of dog shows -- super fun.

440
00:16:20,590 --> 00:16:23,350
如果我出售衣柜公司股份所得到的錢
And if I don't lose all the money that I made

441
00:16:23,350 --> 00:16:25,550
沒有賠個精光
selling my share of this place,

442
00:16:25,550 --> 00:16:27,250
我就很滿意了
I'm happy.

443
00:16:28,130 --> 00:16:30,410
有點像一個時代的終結 對吧
It's kind of the end of an era, huh?

444
00:16:30,964 --> 00:16:32,674
你確定真想這么做嗎
Are you sure you want to do this?

445
00:16:32,674 --> 00:16:34,834
要不是有你 我好多年前就退休了
I'd have quit years ago if you weren't here.

446
00:16:36,064 --> 00:16:37,724
來工作看不到你會感覺很奇怪的
It's gonna be weird coming to work without you.

447
00:16:37,724 --> 00:16:38,944
如果你太想我了
Well, if you miss me too much,

448
00:16:38,944 --> 00:16:42,463
你可以來我的斯黛拉家的狗床工作啊
there'll always be a position for you at Dog Beds by Stella.

449
00:16:42,463 --> 00:16:44,533
多謝了 但我覺得也是時候
Thank you, but I think maybe it is time

450
00:16:44,533 --> 00:16:45,933
證明自己能獨當一面了
I prove myself on my own.

451
00:16:45,933 --> 00:16:47,943
你確定嗎 我這生意可能會一飛沖天呢
You sure? 'Cause this could be huge.

452
00:16:47,943 --> 00:16:50,103
我有無數的狗床點子
I got a million dog-bed ideas.

453
00:16:50,103 --> 00:16:52,613
比如熱狗面包床 太空倉窗
I got a hot-dog bun, I got a space capsule,

454
00:16:52,613 --> 00:16:53,923
還有愛斯基摩人冰屋
I got an igloo.

455
00:16:54,250 --> 00:16:57,050
那狗骨頭形狀的床呢
What about one shaped like a dog bone?

456
00:16:57,050 --> 00:17:00,790
總有一天你也會跟上我的腳步
You'll get there.

457
00:17:00,790 --> 00:17:03,330
莉莉怎么樣了
Hey, how's Lily doing?

458
00:17:03,330 --> 00:17:06,130
我壓根就沒幫上忙 還讓情況惡化了
Well, I certainly didn't help. I only made it worse.

459
00:17:06,130 --> 00:17:08,650
當我們孩子也需要我的時候 我該怎么辦啊
What am I gonna do when our kids need me?

460
00:17:08,650 --> 00:17:10,030
你多慮了
You're overthinking it.

461
00:17:10,030 --> 00:17:12,130
等你看到他們可愛的小臉蛋向你尋求幫助時
The minute you see a sweet little face that needs you,

462
00:17:12,130 --> 00:17:14,370
你的直覺就會讓你知道該怎么做
your instincts will kick in, and you'll know what to do.

463
00:17:14,370 --> 00:17:16,010
大家都這么說
That's what everybody keeps saying,

464
00:17:16,010 --> 00:17:18,090
萬一到時候不是這樣怎么辦
but what if it's not true?

465
00:17:19,710 --> 00:17:20,870
鄧菲先生
Hey, Mr. D.

466
00:17:20,870 --> 00:17:22,250
你還好嗎
Hey. Are you okay?

467
00:17:22,250 --> 00:17:24,550
我好多天沒睡了
I haven't slept for days,

468
00:17:24,550 --> 00:17:27,170
今天還搞砸了工作上的事
and I screwed up at work today.

469
00:17:27,331 --> 00:17:29,251
肯定沒有你覺得的這么糟糕啦
Oh, I'm sure it's not as bad as you think.

470
00:17:29,251 --> 00:17:31,981
攝影師說這就像節目《搞砸舞臺》
Well, the cameraman called it "Disaster-piece Theatre,"

471
00:17:32,090 --> 00:17:33,730
然后大家都說"說到點子上啦 克萊格"
and everybody was like, "Good one, Craig."

472
00:17:33,730 --> 00:17:36,490
有毛病嗎 沒毛病 說到點子上了 克萊格
And you know what? It was. It was a good one, Craig.

473
00:17:36,490 --> 00:17:37,470
沒事的啦
Hey, it's okay.

474
00:17:37,470 --> 00:17:39,410
我明天得再花錢
I had to rehire the crew

475
00:17:39,410 --> 00:17:41,230
重新雇拍攝組來拍一次
to shoot the whole thing again tomorrow.

476
00:17:41,250 --> 00:17:42,280
預算大超支
I'm way over budget.

477
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:43,841
估計也保不住這間待售屋...
I'm probably gonna lose the listing --

478
00:17:44,570 --> 00:17:46,400
你只是累昏頭了
You're just overtired.

479
00:17:46,430 --> 00:17:48,080
要不你先把眼睛閉上
Why don't you close your eyes?

480
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:49,840
迪蘭 制造一點助眠的白噪音
Dylan, make some white noise.

481
00:17:50,380 --> 00:17:52,860
我來試一招
I am going to try something.

482
00:17:53,130 --> 00:17:54,780
挺舒服的
Oh. That's nice.

483
00:18:01,910 --> 00:18:02,750
寶貝
Honey.

484
00:18:03,079 --> 00:18:04,749
你越來越拿手了呢
You're getting really good at this.

485
00:18:05,230 --> 00:18:06,590
你真這么覺得嗎
You think so?

486
00:18:06,590 --> 00:18:08,150
真的
I do.

487
00:18:08,150 --> 00:18:09,830
謝謝
Thanks.

488
00:18:09,939 --> 00:18:12,119
好啦 你現在就好好休息
All right. You just rest now.

489
00:18:12,350 --> 00:18:13,870
一切都會船到橋頭自然直
Everything's gonna be okay.

490
00:18:13,870 --> 00:18:16,950
會的
Yeah. It is.

491
00:18:16,950 --> 00:18:20,330
我可以停下了嗎 我快缺氧暈過去了
Can I stop now? I'm gonna pass out.

492
00:18:23,158 --> 00:18:25,358
我們可以撬開鎖然后把她弄出來
We could just pick the lock and get her out of there.

493
00:18:25,450 --> 00:18:27,270
然后呢 她出來了也不會想跟我們說話
And then what? She doesn't want to talk to us.

494
00:18:27,270 --> 00:18:29,970
她從小就從不跟我們談 我們以前也沒停過手
She never wants to talk to us. That hasn't stopped us before.

495
00:18:30,188 --> 00:18:31,088
我們這次停手
We're only letting it now

496
00:18:31,170 --> 00:18:32,570
只不過是因為自己覺得話題尷尬罷了
because we're uncomfortable, right?

497
00:18:32,570 --> 00:18:33,590
很明顯是你說的這樣
Obviously, you're right.

498
00:18:33,598 --> 00:18:36,437
不然我為什么會大吃特吃歌洛莉亞的藥糊
Why else would I be devouring Gloria's poultice?

499
00:18:36,777 --> 00:18:37,648
我決定了
You know what?

500
00:18:38,047 --> 00:18:39,937
來吧 我們是她爸爸
Come on. We're her dads.

501
00:18:40,237 --> 00:18:41,638
我們會想出辦法的
We'll figure something out.

502
00:18:42,050 --> 00:18:43,330
親愛的
Hey, honey?

503
00:18:43,647 --> 00:18:44,787
大家都走啦
Everyone's gone.

